# No `'use client'` on pages

Page components under `src/app/**/page.tsx` must remain Server Components.

- Never add `'use client'` to a page file
- Keep data fetching, metadata, and composition on the page
- Put interactivity, browser APIs, GSAP, Lenis hooks, and other client-only logic in isolated components under `src/components/`
- Import those client components into the page instead of converting the page itself

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — page.tsx
"use client";
export default function Home() { ... }

// ✅ GOOD — page.tsx stays a server component
import { Hero } from "@/components/hero";
export default function Home() {
  return <Hero />;
}
```
